Subject: [PATCH] feat(nemesis): Study tab closes its Anki gaps
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Audited against docs.ankiweb.net; FSRS core was already right. Added:
- Cloze cards {{c1::text}} / {{c1::text::hint}} — one FSRS schedule per blank
  (cardId#cN), active blank shows [...] or [hint], others revealed; import
  keeps cloze lines whole; Match game excludes them (new cloze.ts, 17 tests).
- Local-day fix: daily caps/shuffle/streaks/heatmap keyed to the student's
  local calendar day, not UTC (reset was ~6-7pm US Central before).
- Card browser live search (front/back/tags) + deck rename (file-backed decks
  rename the vault file first via IPC, reconcile stays linked).
- Undo last grade (button + u key, session-scoped snapshot, tally-aware).
- Leech handling: 8th lapse auto-suspends + tags 'leech', badge in browser.
- Target retention setting (80/85/90/95%) driving fsrs request_retention.
- Session recap in the all-caught-up state (per-grade tallies).

Authored by a subagent; 101/101 study tests green, tsc clean.
